Description: Independently engineered Linux terminal emulator with built-in shell and local AI
 Meridian Terminal is a modern Linux terminal emulator and shell engine
 written in C++20. It includes:
  * High-performance VT100/ANSI screen buffer parser with TrueColor support
  * Meridian Shell with POSIX process groups, job control (fg/bg), and builtins
  * Meridian AI offline assistant for path-based typo corrections, risk
    analysis, and secret redaction.

